[
  {
    "_copyright": "Copyright 2026 Tabsdata Inc.",
    "_comment": "CAPABILITY suite for the Kafka stream source against a redpanda domain: the connector's variants, each CHECKED. Functions in functions/caps_kafka.py; the dead-letter reader in functions/caps_kafka_topics.py. The domain's data plane produces a model's rows as JSON, one message per row, to `<prefix>.<entity>` (one topic per entity, one partition each, created by create-model); the xs seed's messages are appended to ${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl, as every data command below appends its own. `<prefix>` is the domain's per-run in-system name, written ${D0__DB} in the functions and templates, so concurrent runs share no topic or group. VARIANTS, one collection each -- every stream joins its connection's consumer group, and on a one-partition topic a second consumer of a group would sit idle: kafka_in (<prefix>.employees, tabsdata.kafka.trigger.max_rows=25), kafka_dlq (<prefix>.departments, row trigger 5, both fields required, a dlq_topic <prefix>.dead), kafka_time (<prefix>.employees again, tabsdata.kafka.trigger.max_secs marked down to 15s), and dead (kafka_dead over <prefix>.dead, so a dead letter can be counted). STAGES: (1) the domain, seeded; (2) collections and (3) functions -- registering a stream publisher STARTS it, no trigger; (4) actions, tagged live -- a batch to employees, and departments with --schema-changes drop: every other row leaves out dept_name, which kafka_dlq's schema requires, so those go to <prefix>.dead; (5) actions, tagged check -- scripts/verify_kafka.py per variant: kafka_employees and kafka_timed each hold every employees message exactly once, kafka_departments the departments messages that validate and kafka_dead the rest (--require-dead), polling until they arrived (at most 5m); (6) monitor. Run: `tdd xp one-shot --suite kafka/kafka --keep`."
  },
  {
    "domain-manifest": {
      "emit_ops": "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl",
      "domains": [
        {
          "name": "${xp:name(redpanda)}",
          "system": "redpanda",
          "model": "employees",
          "size": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "collections": [
      {
        "name": "kafka_in",
        "type": "kafka_topic_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/kafka_topic_in.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(redpanda)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "kafka_dlq",
        "type": "kafka_topic_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/kafka_topic_in_dlq.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(redpanda)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "kafka_time",
        "type": "kafka_topic_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/kafka_topic_in_time.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(redpanda)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dead",
        "type": "kafka_topic_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/kafka_topic_in_dead.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(redpanda)}"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "functions": [
      {
        "collection": "kafka_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_kafka.py::kafka_in"
      },
      {
        "collection": "kafka_dlq",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_kafka.py::kafka_in_dlq"
      },
      {
        "collection": "kafka_time",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_kafka.py::kafka_in_time"
      },
      {
        "collection": "dead",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_kafka_topics.py::kafka_dead"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "actions": [
      {
        "tdd": {
          "name": "push-employees",
          "tags": [
            "live"
          ],
          "tool": "domain",
          "command": "modify-data",
          "options": [
            "--domain",
            "${xp:name(redpanda)}",
            "--entity",
            "employees",
            "--emit-ops",
            "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "tdd": {
          "name": "push-invalid",
          "tags": [
            "live"
          ],
          "tool": "domain",
          "command": "modify-data",
          "options": [
            "--domain",
            "${xp:name(redpanda)}",
            "--entity",
            "departments",
            "--schema-changes",
            "drop",
            "--emit-ops",
            "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "actions": [
      {
        "parallel": {
          "name": "verify",
          "tags": [
            "check"
          ],
          "lanes": 0,
          "actions": [
            {
              "python": {
                "name": "verify-rows",
                "script": "scripts/verify_kafka.py",
                "params": [
                  "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl",
                  "kafka_in",
                  "--expect",
                  "kafka_employees=employees",
                  "--time-out",
                  "5m",
                  "--profile",
                  "${td:profile}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "python": {
                "name": "verify-time",
                "script": "scripts/verify_kafka.py",
                "params": [
                  "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl",
                  "kafka_time",
                  "--expect",
                  "kafka_timed=employees",
                  "--time-out",
                  "5m",
                  "--profile",
                  "${td:profile}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "python": {
                "name": "verify-dlq",
                "script": "scripts/verify_kafka.py",
                "params": [
                  "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl",
                  "kafka_dlq",
                  "--expect",
                  "kafka_departments=departments",
                  "--dead",
                  "dead/kafka_dead",
                  "--require-dead",
                  "--time-out",
                  "5m",
                  "--profile",
                  "${td:profile}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "monitor": {
      "time_out": "30m"
    }
  }
]
